msgstr "Selecteer Bestand"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:32
msgid "Upload File"
msgstr "Upload Bestand"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:33
msgid "File Upload Notification"
msgstr "Bestand Upload Melding"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:34
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Dear Recipient,%%n%%%%n%%   This is an automatic delivery message to notify "
"you that a new file has been uploaded.%%n%%%%n%%Best Regards"
msgstr ""
"Beste ontvanger,%%n%%%%n%%   Dit is een automatisch bezorgbericht om je te "
"informeren dat er een nieuw bestand is geüpload.%%n%%%%n%%Met vriendelijke "
"groet"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:35
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% uploaded successfully"
msgstr "Bestand %%filename%% succesvol geüpload"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:36
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% uploaded successfully but with warnings"
msgstr "Bestand %%filename%% succesvol geüpload maar met waarschuwingen"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:37
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% not uploaded"
msgstr "Bestand %%filename%% niet geüpload"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:38
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% is being uploaded"
msgstr "Bestand %%filename%% wordt geüpload"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:39
msgid "Your message"
msgstr "Jouw bericht"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:40
msgid "Please fill in the above words: "
msgstr "Vul bovenstaande woorden in a.u.b.:"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:41
msgid "Upload Media"
msgstr "Media uploaden"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:42
msgid "videostream"
msgstr "videostream"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:43
msgid "screenshot"
msgstr "schermafbeelding"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:44
msgid ""
"By activating this option I agree to let the website keep my personal data"
msgstr ""
"Door deze optie te activeren ga ik ermee akkoord dat de website mijn "
"persoonlijke gegevens bewaart"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:45
msgid ""
"You have denied to let the website keep your personal data. Upload cannot "
"continue!"
msgstr ""
"Je hebt geweigerd dat de website je persoonlijke gegevens bewaart. De upload "
"kan niet doorgaan!"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:59
msgid "Remove Remote"
msgstr "Extern verwijderen"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:60
msgid "Remove this remote file"
msgstr "Dit externe bestand verwijderen"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:61
msgid "Sort list based on this column"
msgstr "Sorteer lijst gebaseerd op deze kolom"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:62
msgid "guest"
msgstr "gast"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:63
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "onbekend"

#. error messages
#: lib/wfu_constants.php:65
msgid ""
"Error. Could not resolve ftp target filedir. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kon het ftp doel filedir niet vinden. Controleer het domein in "
"'ftpinfo' attribuut."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:66
msgid "Error. Invalid ftp information. Check 'ftpinfo' attribute."
msgstr "Fout. Foutieve ftp informatie. Controleer 'ftpinfo' attribuut."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:67
msgid ""
"Error. Could not extract ftp information from 'ftpinfo' attribute. Check its "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kon geen ftp informatie halen uit 'ftpinfo' attribuut. Controleer de "
"syntax."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:68
msgid ""
"Error. Could not resolve ftp target filename. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kon het ftp bestandsnaamdoel niet vinden. Controleer het domein in "
"'ftpinfo' attribuut."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:69
msgid ""
"Error. Could not open source file for ftp upload. Check if file is "
"accessible."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kan het bronbestand niet openen voor ftp-upload. Controleer of het "
"bestand toegankelijk is."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:70
msgid "Error. Could not send data to ftp target file."
msgstr "Fout. Kan geen gegevens naar het ftp-doelbestand verzenden."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:71
msgid ""
"Error. Could not connect to ftp host. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kan geen verbinding maken met de ftp-host. Controleer het domein in "
"het attribuut 'ftpinfo'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:72
msgid ""
"Error. Could not authenticate to ftp host. Check username and password in "
"'ftpinfo' attribute."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kan niet authenticeren bij de ftp-host. Controleer de gebruikersnaam "
"en het wachtwoord in het attribuut 'ftpinfo'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:73
msgid ""
"Error. Could not initialize sftp subsystem. Please check if the server "
"supports sftp."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Kan het sftp-subsysteem niet initialiseren. Controleer of de server "
"sftp ondersteunt."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:74
msgid "Error. The web server does not support sftp."
msgstr "Fout. De webserver ondersteunt geen sftp."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:75
msgid "Error. The web server does not support ftps."
msgstr "Fout. De webserver ondersteunt geen ftps."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:76
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Error. The upload size limit of PHP directive upload_max_filesize is "
"preventing the upload of big files.\n"
"PHP directive upload_max_filesize limit is: %s.\n"
"To increase the limit change the value of the directive from php.ini.\n"
"If you don't have access to php.ini, then try adding the following line to "
"your .htaccess file:\n"
"\n"
"php_value upload_max_filesize 10M\n"
"\n"
"(adjust the size according to your needs)\n"
"\n"
"The file .htaccess is found in your website root directory (where index.php "
"is found).\n"
"If your don't have this file, then create it.\n"
"If this does not work either, then contact your domain provider."
msgstr ""
"Fout. De uploadgroottelimiet van de PHP-directive upload_max_filesize "
"verhindert het uploaden van grote bestanden.\n"
"De limiet van de PHP-directive upload_max_filesize is: %s.\n"
"Om de limiet te verhogen, wijzig je de waarde van de directive in php.ini.\n"
"Als je geen toegang hebt tot php.ini, probeer dan de volgende regel toe te "
"voegen aan je .htaccess-bestand:\n"
"\n"
"php_value upload_max_filesize 10M\n"
"\n"
"(pas de grootte aan volgens je behoeften)\n"
"\n"
"Het bestand .htaccess bevindt zich in de hoofdmap van je website (waar "
"index.php zich bevindt).\n"
"Als je dit bestand niet hebt, maak het dan aan.\n"
"Als dit ook niet werkt, neem dan contact op met je domeinprovider."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:77
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The upload time limit of PHP directive max_input_time is preventing the "
"upload of big files.\n"
"PHP directive max_input_time limit is: %s seconds.\n"
"To increase the limit change the value of the directive from php.ini.\n"
"If you don't have access to php.ini, then add the following line to "
"your .htaccess file:\n"
"\n"
"php_value max_input_time 500\n"
"\n"
"(adjust the time according to your needs)\n"
"\n"
"The file .htaccess is found in your website root directory (where index.php "
"is found).\n"
"If your don't have this file, then create it.\n"
"If this does not work either, then contact your domain provider."
msgstr ""
"De uploadtijdlimiet van de PHP-directive max_input_time verhindert het "
"uploaden van grote bestanden.\n"
"De limiet van de PHP-directive max_input_time is: %s seconden.\n"
"Om de limiet te verhogen, wijzig je de waarde van de directive in php.ini.\n"
"Als je geen toegang hebt tot php.ini, voeg dan de volgende regel toe aan "
"je .htaccess-bestand:\n"
"\n"
"php_value max_input_time 500\n"
"\n"
"(pas de tijd aan volgens je behoeften)\n"
"\n"
"Het bestand .htaccess bevindt zich in de hoofdmap van je website (waar "
"index.php zich bevindt).\n"
"Als je dit bestand niet hebt, maak het dan aan.\n"
"Als dit ook niet werkt, neem dan contact op met je domeinprovider."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:78
msgid ""
"Error. Permission denied to write to target folder.\n"
"Check and correct read/write permissions of target folder."
msgstr ""
"Fout. Geen toestemming tot schrijven naar doelmap.\n"
"Controleer en corrigeer de lees/schrijf rechten van de doelmap."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:79
msgid ""
"Error. This file was rejected because its extension is not correct. Its "
"proper filename is: "
msgstr ""
"Fout. Dit bestand werd geweigerd omdat de extensie niet correct is. De "
"correcte bestandnaam is: "

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:80
msgid "Error. This file was rejected because it does not have a MIME type."
msgstr "Fout. Dit bestand is geweigerd omdat het geen MIME-type heeft."

