msgid "Potential Denial-Of-Service Attack on {SITE}"
msgstr "Mogelijke Denial-Of-Service-aanval op {SITE}"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:185
msgid ""
"Hello admin\n"
"\n"
"This is a message from Iptanus File Upload Plugin to notify you that a "
"potential Denial-Of-Service attack has been detected on {SITE}.\n"
"\n"
"The plugin detected more than {FILENUM} uploads within {INTERVAL} seconds.\n"
"\n"
"All file uploads that exceed this limit are rejected to protect the website "
"from overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"Please check the upload history log in the plugin's area in Dashboard for "
"any suspicious behaviour.\n"
"\n"
"A new message will follow if the situation remains.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks"
msgstr ""
"Hallo beheerder\n"
"\n"
"Dit is een bericht van de Iptanus File Upload-plugin om je te melden dat er "
"een mogelijke Denial-Of-Service-aanval is gedetecteerd op {SITE}.\n"
"\n"
"De plugin heeft meer dan {FILENUM} uploads binnen {INTERVAL} seconden "
"gedetecteerd.\n"
"\n"
"Alle bestandsuploads die deze limiet overschrijden worden geweigerd om de "
"website tegen overbelasting te beschermen.\n"
"\n"
"Controleer het uploadgeschiedenislogboek in het plugin-gedeelte in het "
"Dashboard op verdacht gedrag.\n"
"\n"
"Er volgt een nieuw bericht als de situatie aanhoudt.\n"
"\n"
"Bedankt"

